---
// Embeds the session the middleware already loaded, so the client
// React island renders as "guest" or "authenticated" on first paint
// instead of waiting for a `/api/auth/get-session` round-trip.
//
// Contract (three serialized states, mutually distinguishable):
// - user object: the middleware proved a session (id/email/name/
//   twoFactorEnabled subset, JSON-safe).
// - literal `null`: PROVED guest (getSession affirmatively returned no
//   session — typically fast: no cookie, no DB work). The client may
//   resolve `guest` instantly (slice-11 fast path).
// - literal `"unknown"`: the middleware GAVE UP (800ms timeout or
//   throw) and proved nothing. The client must resolve `loading` and
//   wait for the live session check — resolving `guest` here is the
//   refresh-while-authed gate flash. `null` must never be reused for
//   this state.
//
// The page's <head> reads `Astro.locals.session / .user` (set by
// middleware/auth.ts): either `undefined` (unknown) serializes as
// `"unknown"`. Anything else the React app needs is
// fetched lazily via useProfile() / apiGetMe() after hydration.
//
// The `client:load` islands on the page hydrate AFTER this script
// has been parsed (script tags are blocking; the React island is
// loaded async by `client:load`). On read, the client must handle
// the case where the script is absent (auth pages, transit
// navigation that re-runs only the islands, dev HMR) — absent also
// resolves `loading` but stays distinguishable from unknown for
// logging/tests (see readInitialSessionTag in lib/auth.ts).
---
<script
  is:inline
  type="application/json"
  id="pesdac:initial-session"
  set:html={JSON.stringify(
    Astro.locals.session === undefined || Astro.locals.user === undefined
      ? "unknown"
      : Astro.locals.session && Astro.locals.user
        ? {
            id: Astro.locals.user.id,
            email: Astro.locals.user.email,
            name: Astro.locals.user.name,
            twoFactorEnabled:
              (Astro.locals.user as { twoFactorEnabled?: boolean })
                .twoFactorEnabled === true,
          }
        : null,
  )}
/>
